# LaTeX build artefacts. `make` regenerates them from main.tex +
# references.bib + the figures. The published main.pdf is tracked
# (so the paper can be read without rebuilding); everything else
# is transient.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex.gz

# Session-local scratch (review prompts, build notes) — not for publication.
REVIEW_PROMPT.md
